        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-27T12:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I feel like I'm getting better with strategies, but I'v been focusing on spirits I don't quite get recently. Usually I'm playing adversaries at lvl2, or with prussia at lvl3. I have not been loosing much but some of those games have still been really close and especially in my last River/Nightmare game against England.</p><p>I might take some more familiar spirits and try and up the difficulty a bit. But I feel like I still don't have a solid enough grasp with River and the \"soft defense\" strategies to be able to combat the higher difficulties.</p>",
