        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-27T18:45:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Drew one good defense power, got a fear card that pushed and 2 straight turns had Dahan stomp massed invader forces, while river destroyed the other city.</p><p>Flipping the fear cards and getting terror 2 involved some luck, but pushing dahan and invaders together is my go to early game. &nbsp;I gambled on the 3rd wave 1 land and guessed right (I mean it's a 50-50) and it worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
